Calizara stone viper~
Calizara the Stone Viper~
Calizara the Stone Viper rears here, enormous and terrible.
~
Calizara is a serpent of impossible size, her scales fused with canyon stone
into a natural armor of geological hardness. Her head alone is the size of a
wagon, and her venom has dissolved gouges into the chamber walls. Ancient and
malevolent, she regards you as an insult.
~
