Kresh dust colossus~
Kresh the Dust Colossus~
Kresh the Dust Colossus fills this chamber with its bulk.
~
Kresh is a creature of compressed desert earth and ancient stone magic,
standing forty feet tall and built like a moving mesa. Its face is a
featureless expanse of smoothed sandstone, and its footsteps register as
minor tremors throughout the arroyo. It has been here since before the
canyon itself was carved.
~
